OL,3,AChancellor to cut tariffs on marmalade
OL,4,Aand other products to help with
OL,5,Acost-of-living
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Conservatives said the offer of
OL,8,F"cheaper gherkins" was "an insult to
OL,9,Ffamilies hammered by Labour's tax
OL,10,Frises".
OL,12,FThe BBC understands the government will
OL,13,Falso freeze fuel duty again in the
OL,14,FBudget, while the Times reports it may
OL,15,Falso slow the pace of pay increases for
OL,16,Fyounger workers on the minimum wage.
